            "expect": "fs1:4deaf1a2d9ce94fb",
            "note": "Swivel fold tool. Hold Option (Alt on Windows and Linux) and click inside the paper halfway between the centre and the bottom edge: where the creases meet. Then click three landmarks the creases run to: the right edge’s midpoint, the left edge’s midpoint, the bottom edge’s midpoint. Click the lower left of the paper (it stays put). Fourth crease 1 of 3, straight up the middle, is the first that fits: the upper half folds over along it while the bottom swivels. Press Enter."
